        <item>
            <title>0.3.22</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:30:50 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.22</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Direct screenshot actions with icons

**Copy & Discard** is now its own button beside **Copy & Close**. One click copies the annotated screenshot and closes without saving to Desktop. The dropdown has been removed.

Copy, Copy & Close, Copy & Discard and Save all have icons and labels, with room to fit in the smallest window. Default 100% image sizing and zoom are retained.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/justaicode/relay-updates/releases/download/v0.3.22/Relay-0.3.22-macOS.zip" length="4246514" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ni/QQH1voxZKiHci54CcIo12Q2lfujSN63L3bx4y2teGjpoxVdAPbez1eAp6J06b3DpejGimLhlNp+flQ4o2Dw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.3.21</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:53:01 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>26</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.21</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Copy a screenshot without saving to Desktop

Open the small dropdown beside **Copy & Close** and choose **Copy & Discard** to copy the annotated screenshot and close the editor without creating a Desktop file.

**Copy & Close** still copies and saves to Desktop. **Discard** still closes without copying or saving. Screenshot sizing and zoom remain included.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/justaicode/relay-updates/releases/download/v0.3.21/Relay-0.3.21-macOS.zip" length="4246977" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="XOzlBjaTJKblGKVQzn3nFemkDSr13Ea62LrqnHnkrLG1DxHtdjc6Dp/ME7lxrdjZkp49Q6Jc9U3yj1GEADrCDw=="/>
        </item>
